  {
   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "习近平指出，过去的一年很不寻常、很不平凡。人民军队深入推进政治整训，有效应对各种风险挑战，在反腐败斗争中经受革命性锻造。全军广大官兵特别是基层官兵坚定听党话、跟党走，忠诚履职尽责，聚力攻坚克难，圆满完成各项任务，是完全过得硬、信得过的。",
   "en": "Describing the past year as highly unusual and extraordinary, Xi said the people's armed forces had advanced in-depth political rectification, effectively addressed various risks and challenges, and undergone a revolutionary tempering in the fight against corruption. Officers and soldiers across the armed forces, especially those at the grassroots level, had been steadfast in following the Party's commands, faithfully fulfilled their duties, pooled strength to overcome challenges, and successfully accomplished all tasks, proving themselves capable and dependable, Xi said.",
